FindMeAFlat
===========

Crawls German real-estate portals for new listings and notifies via Telegram.


Provenance
----------

This repository descends from work by Adrian Kumpf, who wrote the original
Node.js implementation beginning 2016-11-13 (commit 6d77323, "Add basic
scraper"). That original repository, github.com/adriankumpf/findmeaflat, is
no longer available.

GitHub records this repository's fork parent as github.com/mischkew/findmeaflat
(Sven Mkw), which is the route the fork was taken through. None of that
repository's own commits are present here — verified across all refs — so the
code lineage in this repository runs directly from Adrian Kumpf's work.

Authorship of the Node.js implementation, by commit count across full history:

  Adrian Kumpf   93 commits   2016-11-13 onward   original author
  Chris Xu       86 commits   2021-03-25 onward   maintainer
                                                  (also committed as
                                                   "Chris Reichel")

Automated dependency commits (Dependabot) account for the remainder.


Licensing history
-----------------

No LICENSE file has ever existed in this repository, nor in the
mischkew/findmeaflat repository it was forked from. The only licence
assertion is a single field in package.json:

    "license": "MIT"

This NOTICE records that fact rather than resolving it. The Node.js
implementation is retained here for history and is not the subject of any
licence grant made by the current maintainer on the original author's behalf.


The Elixir implementation
-------------------------

The Elixir rewrite proposed in
docs/proposals/1-draft/001-elixir-multi-tenant-rewrite/ is a from-scratch
reimplementation: a different language, a different architecture, and no code
carried over from the Node.js implementation. It is a new work, and its licence
is stated in LICENSE.
